# In the Name of Science (otherAreas 76), the status operands. Emptiness Bleeds current (The Warriors' Path completed),
# available: a base traded: nothing (accepted or completed wanted); the pie with a target (a GM: NAME_OF_SCIENCE_target
# 15496, the Snow Gorget): nothing; the organs one short: nothing; the trigger: 524 (the available arm first, the target
# held), begun. The organs' trade reads no status: available again (a GM) with the target, the Snow Gorget's organs (10
# Phuabo, 5 Aern, 1 Yovra): 529; its finish: the Snow Gorget, the target 0, completed from available
# (Quest[4][76]Prog 1 (GM) kept: npcUtil.completeQuest has no cleanup). Completed, no
# target: 525; the Sanative Earring base (a Silver Earring, a White Chip): 526, the target 14791; 531's hint 17 with
# the pie; then 532 or 528 (Silver Earring, White Chip).
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=82.5,-25.0,3.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop EmptinessBleeds current
item Gorget
item ClearChip
item ApplePie x2
item PhuaboOrgan x10
item AernOrgan x5
item YovraOrgan x1
item SilverEarring
item WhiteChip
login
trade Yurim Gorget x1 ClearChip x1      # available, no target: nothing
charvar NAME_OF_SCIENCE_target 15496    # a GM: the Snow Gorget
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # available, a target: nothing
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x10 AernOrgan x4 YovraOrgan x1   # one Aern short: nothing
trigger Yurim                           # UseFallback 0: the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # available (a target held): 524
finish option=0                         # begun (no option read)
quest OtherAreas.InTheNameOfScience available   # a GM
charvar Quest[4][76]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (npcUtil.completeQuest keeps it)
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x10 AernOrgan x5 YovraOrgan x1   # the target's organs, no status read: 529
finish                                  # the Snow Gorget; the target 0; completed from available
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # completed, no target: 525
finish
trade Yurim SilverEarring x1 WhiteChip x1   # completed, no target: the Sanative Earring base: 526 (Silver Earring, White Chip)
finish                                  # both taken
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # completed, a target: 531 (Apple Pie, 0, 17)
finish                                  # the pie taken
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # completed, a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Earring, White Chip)
finish
